# ── Personal photographs and bulky pipeline evidence ─────────────────────────────────────
# Kept OFF the public repository (docs/agent-workflow/asset-audit.md). The text, JSON and
# attribution records under evidence/ stay tracked; only the image binaries are ignored, and
# the originals live in the owner's private backup. The pipeline's own store for these is the
# asset bucket (docs/pipeline-2k.md), not git.
/iCloud Photos from*/
/evidence/photos/**/*.jpg
/evidence/photos/**/*.jpeg
/evidence/photos/**/*.png
/evidence/candidates/**/*.png
/evidence/candidates/**/*.jpg
/evidence/segmentation/**/*.png
/evidence/segmentation/**/*.jpg
/evidence/segmentation/**/*.jpeg
